  "description_short": "Fresh sushi and Japanese classics in George's city centre, blending quality ingredients with friendly service.",
  "description_long": "Tucked into York Street in the heart of George, Shan Sushi has built a loyal following for its fresh sushi platters and authentic Japanese fare. The relaxed atmosphere makes it equally suited for a quick lunch or a leisurely dinner, with generous portions that won't break the bank.\n\nThe menu covers all the classics — from California rolls to salmon roses — alongside tempura, noodle dishes, and bento boxes. Regulars rave about the freshness of the fish and the attention to detail in presentation. It's a straightforward spot without pretension, where the focus stays firmly on good food and welcoming service.\n\nConveniently located in George Central, it's an easy stop whether you're a local craving sushi or passing through the Garden Route. The mid-range pricing and consistent quality have made it a go-to for Japanese food in the area.",
